.TH start-cli-registry-package-access 1  "access "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-registry\-package\-access \- Commands to manage private package access
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli registry package access\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Commands to manage private package access
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
start\-cli\-registry\-package\-access\-add\-reader(1)
Allow a signer to see a private package
.TP
start\-cli\-registry\-package\-access\-get(1)
Show whether a package is private and which signers can see it
.TP
start\-cli\-registry\-package\-access\-remove\-reader(1)
Revoke a signer\*(Aqs access to a private package
.TP
start\-cli\-registry\-package\-access\-set\-private(1)
Set whether a package is private
